{
    "rss_url": "https://rss.ovh/telegram/channel/ZaihuaNews",
    "discord_webhook_url": "https://discord.com/api/webhooks/...",
    "check_interval": 600,
    "log_level": "INFO",
    "max_retries": 3,
    "timeout": 30,
    "filter_keywords": [
        "开奖完成通知"
    ],
    "proxy": {
        "enabled": false,
        "http": "http://127.0.0.1:8080",
        "https": "https://127.0.0.1:8080",
        "auth": {
            "enabled": false,
            "username": "",
            "password": ""
        }
    },
    "ai_config": {
        "enabled": true,
        "api_key": "sk-",
        "base_url": "https://openrouter.ai/api/v1",
        "model": "gemini-3-pro-preview",
        "audit_model": "deepseek/deepseek-v3.1-terminus",
        "optimization_model": "gemini-3-pro-preview",
        "preprocessing_model": "deepseek/deepseek-v3.1-terminus",
        "preprocessing": {
            "enabled": true,
            "prompt": "1. **移除干扰内容**：删除与正文弱关联的引用内容和文末无意义的签名或广告。\n2. **去重**：如果摘要内容与标题基本一致（语义重复），返回空字符串。\n3. **保留Markdown格式**：输入输出均为Markdown格式，保留加粗、斜体、链接等格式。\n4. **纯净输出**：不要添加任何解释、前缀（如'处理后：'）或额外标注。"
        }
    },
    "web_config": {
        "admin_password": "admin"
    },
    "url_shortener": {
        "enabled": true,
        "domain": "http://localhost:8080",
        "host": "localhost",
        "port": 8080
    }
}